      "note": "Reviewed the selected transaction receipt and call trace, the commit-pinned reproduction, PositionManager's verified runtime source, its creation transaction, and runtime bytecode at deployment and immediately before the exploit. The trace enters PositionManager.executeDecreaseOrder, updates ShortsTracker, calls OrderBook, and re-enters the attacker callback before the outer position transition is complete. The selected transaction contains the inflated GLP mint/redemption loop and the Vault reserve outflows. Loss quantities are each token's net Vault outflow in this transaction; same-transaction attacker deposits are subtracted. PositionManager is a direct contract whose deployment and pre-exploit runtime hashes are identical."
